      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the tightness isn't like, choking or anything. it just feels a bit weird and uncomfortable. if i take a double dose of benadryl it should definitely calm the swelling down right? i'd rather just stay home than deal with an er waiting room if i can manage it with meds.",
